{
  "_id": "urdeAQ97E84UsaxK",
  "name": "王座之旨捕网 Net of Throne's Command (BMT)",
  "type": "weapon",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "39",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>武器（捕网），极珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>这把武器嵌有华丽的金丝，饰以深蓝色和栗色的珠宝。你使用该武器进行的攻击检定和伤害掷骰获得+1加值。此外，你获得威吓&amp;Reference[skill=Intimidation]和游说&amp;Reference[skill=Persuasion]两个技能中你没有熟练项技能的熟练。</p><p><em><strong>施法Spellcasting。 </strong></em>该武器有5发充能。你可以用一个附赠动作并花费1发或多发充能来施展以下法术之一（豁免 DC 16）： <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.Ja6HpsLeGA9MQ0Rm]{命令术 Command}</em>（1充能）、 <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.T4zFq0zTHnzZeO9t]{诚实之域 Zone of Truth}</em>（2充能）、 <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.RpBbOYseLZCFXaFY]{强迫术 Compulsion}</em>（4 充能）、<em> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.lopw7wVkPoE7gbNu]{放逐术 Banishment}</em>（4充能）、<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.JudswpO6E5GBlyfQ]{支配人类 Dominate Person}</em>（5充能）。</p><p>该武器每天在黎明时恢复[[/r 1d4]]发已消耗的充能。</p><p>特别的，一只被捕网命中的大型或更小体型生物将被束缚，束缚状态持续至该生物解脱。捕网不能影响无形体生物，以及巨型或更大体型的生物。一个生物可以用动作进行一次[[/save ability=str dc=10]]检定，以解脱自己或其触及范围内另一生物的束缚状态。对网造成5点挥砍伤害（AC10）同样可以解脱生物的束缚状态而不伤害及生物本身，并以此摧毁捕网进而终止束缚效应。</p><p>    当用捕网以一个动作、附赠动作或反应进行攻击时，你只能攻击一次，而不论你正常情况下可发动攻击的次数。</p><p>This weapon is bedecked in ornate gold filigree and deep-blue and maroon jewels. You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this weapon. Additionally, you gain proficiency in the &amp;Reference[skill=Intimidation] and &amp;Reference[skill=Persuasion] skills if you don't already have it.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Spellcasting\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Spellcasting.</span> The weapon has 5 charges. You can use a bonus action and expend 1 or more of its charges to cast one of the following spells (save DC 16): @spell[Command] (1 charge), @spell[Zone of Truth] (2 charges), @spell[Compulsion] (4 charges), @spell[Banishment] (4 charges), or @spell[Dominate Person] (5 charges).</p><p>The weapon regains [[/r 1d4]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Special\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Special.</span> A Large or smaller creature hit by a net is &amp;Reference[condition=restrained] until it is freed. A net has no effect on creatures that are formless, or creatures that are Huge or larger. A creature can use its action to make a [[/save ability=str dc=10]] check, freeing itself or another creature within its reach on a success. Dealing 5 slashing damage to the net (AC 10) also frees the creature without harming it, ending the effect and destroying the net. When you use an action, bonus action, or reaction to attack with a net, you can make only one attack regardless of the number of attacks you can normally make.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
